rs raised an objection to longer working"}, {"t": "hours. 工人们反对延长工作时间。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4238, "y": 0.4534, "w": 0.296, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "He invited the committee members to give their", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.4738, "w": 0.426, "h": 0.0161}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.4748, "w": 0.3465, "h": 0.0138, "t": "ed the committee members to give their"}, {"c": 0.3, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.4896, "w": 0.1799, "h": 0.0159, "t": "till 32 filteD"}, {"t": "opinion.他请委员们提意见。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.4913, "w": 0.2556, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "After hours of negotiation, the two sides reached a", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.5116, "w": 0.4507, "h": 0.0162}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.5118, "w": 0.3729, "h": 0.0148, "t": "urs of negotiation, the two sides reached a"}, {"t": "compromise. 经过数小时的谈判，双方达成了妥协。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.5289, "w": 0.4529, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "The shareholders took a vote on the proposed merger.", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.5493, "w": 0.4798, "h": 0.0162}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.55, "w": 0.4026, "h": 0.0148, "t": "eholders took a vote on the proposed merger."}, {"t": "股东们就拟议的合并进行了表决。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.4238, "y": 0.5669, "w": 0.287, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "Ending the meeting 结束会议", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.6204, "w": 0.3767, "h": 0.022}, {"t": "After the meeting 会议后", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5112, "y": 0.6204, "w": 0.3251, "h": 0.0236}, {"t": "You can 可以：", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.0762, "y": 0.6627, "w": 0.1345, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "It is usual to 通常要：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5336, "y": 0.6627, "w": 0.1906, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "• adjourn the meeting until a later date", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0762, "y": 0.6802, "w": 0.361, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "• write up the minutes 把会议记录整理", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5336, "y": 0.6802, "w": 0.3587, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "休会，以后再续", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1031, "y": 0.6962, "w": 0.139, "h": 0.016}, {"t": "成文", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.5628, "y": 0.6975, "w": 0.0404, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "• close the meeting 结束会议", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0762, "y": 0.7151, "w": 0.2691, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "• circulate the minutes 分发会议记录", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5336, "y": 0.7151, "w": 0.3408, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "• bring the meeting to a cose 使会议", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.0762, "y": 0.7323, "w": 0.343, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "结束", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1031, "y": 0.7484, "w": 0.0404, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "The chairman brought the meeting to", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1031, "y": 0.7674, "w": 0.3251, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "a close by thanking all those who had", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1009, "y": 0.7832, "w": 0.3274, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "attended. 主席向所有与会者表示感谢并", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1009, "y": 0.8009, "w": 0.3498, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "宣布会议结束。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1009, "y": 0.8169, "w": 0.13, "h": 0.0174}]}